    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-686DF6BA528065A8-Q16">
      <question_stem>공 모양 비눗방울의 직경이 20 mm이고, 내부와 외부의 압력차가 10 Pa일 때, 비눗방울 표면에서 발생하는 표면장력[N/m]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="수치/계산 도출형" category="수리·계산·자료해석형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>모양</keyword>
        <keyword>비눗방울</keyword>
        <keyword>직경</keyword>
        <keyword>이고</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>0.05</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 수리수문학 · 표면장력
정답은 ②이다. 공식 정답에 따르면 구형 액면의 내외 압력차 식 ΔP = 4σ/D를 적용한다. σ = ΔP × D ÷ 4 = 10 × 0.02 ÷ 4 = 0.05 N/m이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.01</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>0.05</choice_text>
          <commentary>σ = ΔP·D/4 = 10 × 0.02/4 = 0.05 N/m이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.1</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>0.2</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
